  "book.runicrebirth.runic_codex.foundation.adept_ascension.description": "",
  "book.runicrebirth.runic_codex.foundation.adept_ascension.info.text": "You have mastered the basics of spellcasting. New spell forms and modifiers are now available to you. Seek out the intermediate spells in the **Spells** category.",
  "book.runicrebirth.runic_codex.foundation.adept_ascension.info.title": "Adept Ascension",
  "book.runicrebirth.runic_codex.foundation.adept_ascension.name": "Adept Ascension",
  "book.runicrebirth.runic_codex.foundation.arch_ascension.description": "",
  "book.runicrebirth.runic_codex.foundation.arch_ascension.info.text": "Your mastery of the arcane arts has reached its peak. The most powerful spell forms are now within your grasp. Seek out the advanced spells in the **Spells** category.",
  "book.runicrebirth.runic_codex.foundation.arch_ascension.info.title": "Arch Ascension",
  "book.runicrebirth.runic_codex.foundation.arch_ascension.name": "Arch Ascension",
  "book.runicrebirth.runic_codex.foundation.introduction.description": "An introduction to the Runic Codex.",
  "book.runicrebirth.runic_codex.foundation.introduction.name": "Introduction",
  "book.runicrebirth.runic_codex.foundation.introduction.systems.text": "To cast a spell, equip a **wand** and use it to open the **Drawing Canvas**.\\n\\nOn the canvas, select a **tier** to reveal available spell shapes and modifiers. Draw the shape of the spell you wish to cast. Select an **element** to imbue your spell with elemental power.\\n\\nEach element grants unique effects: **Fire** ignites, **Ice** slows, **Earth** empowers blunt force, **Wind** sharpens, and **Arcane** fuels spirit magic.",
  "book.runicrebirth.runic_codex.foundation.introduction.systems.title": "How Magic Works",
  "book.runicrebirth.runic_codex.foundation.introduction.welcome.text": "Welcome to the **Runic Codex**, your guide to the arcane arts of Runic Rebirth.\\n\\nWithin these pages you will find knowledge of every spell, modifier, and technique available to a practitioner of the runic arts.\\n\\nBegin by studying the basic spells in the **Spells** category. As you grow in power, return here to unlock the paths of **Adept Ascension** and **Arch Ascension**.",
  "book.runicrebirth.runic_codex.foundation.introduction.welcome.title": "Welcome",
  "book.runicrebirth.runic_codex.foundation.name": "Foundation",
  "book.runicrebirth.runic_codex.name": "Runic Codex",
  "book.runicrebirth.runic_codex.spells.adept_spellcasting.description": "",
  "book.runicrebirth.runic_codex.spells.adept_spellcasting.entity.text": "You have learned the fundamental spell forms. Your growing mastery unlocks access to intermediate spells.\\n\\nSee **Adept Ascension** in the Foundation category for more details.",
  "book.runicrebirth.runic_codex.spells.adept_spellcasting.name": "Adept Spellcasting",
  "book.runicrebirth.runic_codex.spells.arch_spellcasting.description": "",
  "book.runicrebirth.runic_codex.spells.arch_spellcasting.entity.text": "The intermediate arts hold no more secrets for you. Your power has grown enough to wield the most devastating spell forms.\\n\\nSee **Arch Ascension** in the Foundation category for more details.",
  "book.runicrebirth.runic_codex.spells.arch_spellcasting.name": "Arch Spellcasting",
